node_modules/
dist/

# public/fonts/*.woff2, public/logo/ and public/pfp/ are COMMITTED although a
# script regenerates them (`npm run prepare:all && npm run fonts`): the script
# reads the parent project's art and font sources, which a repository made from
# this folder alone does not have, and a build without them ships no logo, no
# portraits and fallback fonts.

# Design-canvas working output
design/_preview/
design/fine-avians-club-mint-site.html

# esbuild output for `npm test`
.test-build/

# Secrets. The site reads no secret and never should; the rule is here so the
# first .env somebody writes is not one `git add -A` away from public. Vite
# also loads *.local files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
.vite/

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Working notes. Plans and reports are internal; README.md is the one document
# that is published with the code.
*-PLAN.md
*-REPORT.md
PLAN.md
